  "description": "**Goal:** clear all three pyramids onto the waste pile.\n\n- Play any **fully uncovered** peak or base card onto the waste if it is one rank **up or down** from the waste's top card.\n- Rank **wraps**: an Ace and a King are adjacent, so either can follow the other.\n- Removing both cards covering a peak card flips it face-up and makes it playable.\n- Draw the **stock** onto the waste when stuck (one pass only). No legal move with an empty stock means the game is **lost**.\n- Your **score** is the number of peak and base cards cleared, 28 for a win.",
